              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Manase riemo ju m’ubedo i Beth-cean woko ngo ku pacune de, kadi mi Tanak ku pacune de ngo, kadi ju m’ubedo i Dor ku pacune de ngo, kadi ju m’ubedo i Ibleam ku pacune de ngo, kadi ju m’ubedo i Megido ku pacune de ngo; ento Jukanani giceri i ng’om maeno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kan Israel udoko tek, nia giketho Jukanani i tic ma jumuli ko, e giriemogi woko ndhu ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
