              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naftali riemo ju m’ubedo i Beth-cemec woko ngo, kadi ju m’ubedo i Beth-anath de ngo; ento ebedo i kind Jukanani, ma gi ju m’ubedo i ng’ombe: ento ju m’ubedo i Beth-cemec ku ju m’ubedo i Beth-anath gidoko jutic mi tic ma jumuli ko.",
          "type": "text",
